{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"y":0.06395348811333379,"w":0.053633219401041654,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"Test 2","x":0.086505189524021919},{"c":1,"t":"READING PASSAGE 3","x":0.08823530005956802,"w":0.25951555887858074,"y":0.11191860441341484,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"w":0.71809499104817709,"y":0.14769011462647386,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 27-40, which are based on Reading","x":0.088182998950548971,"c":1,"h":0.022260639198682264},{"w":0.14359862009684246,"x":0.088235291921537895,"h":0.017539506195474064,"y":0.16860465087021226,"c":1,"t":"Passage 3 below."},{"x":0.30213218848751988,"h":0.034006728752248305,"c":1,"w":0.29194404602050783,"t":"Artificial Intelligence","y":0.18920897831865069},{"y":0.23967809630248149,"t":"In many countries in the West, hysteria","x":0.086505192378820081,"w":0.30449826558430987,"c":1,"h":0.01613585710358667},{"y":0.25717284798607865,"w":0.35121106465657553,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565315,"x":0.086505194226955281,"t":"about the future of artificial intelligence (AI)"},{"x":0.084775083412264862,"h":0.016095171448565315,"y":0.27606717974830364,"w":0.35294118245442707,"c":1,"t":"is everywhere. There seems to be no shortage"},{"h":0.014695591322603119,"c":1,"y":0.29356193112093876,"x":0.086505187914461268,"w":0.33391003926595053,"t":"of sensationalist news about how AI could"},{"h":0.018821872473597234,"w":0.33585261027018232,"y":0.31042932658918554,"x":0.086378057933859456,"t":"cure diseases, accelerate human innovation","c":1},{"x":0.086505192494267691,"y":0.32994186017145477,"w":0.33910034179687498,"h":0.017503905913644591,"c":1,"t":"and improve human creativity. Just looking"},{"w":0.34775085449218751,"x":0.086505195521406938,"h":0.017502888839006303,"c":1,"t":"at the media headlines, you might think that","y":0.34883720901625215},{"t":"we are already living in a future where AI","h":0.017555779389687665,"w":0.33044982910156251,"c":1,"x":0.086505189203544011,"y":0.3662790699810301},{"w":0.29411763509114586,"h":0.017554762982421201,"x":0.086505196210024449,"y":0.38517441831887378,"t":"has infiltrated every aspect of society.","c":1},{"x":0.088091354481334844,"h":0.020363186355067509,"y":0.41869611663568906,"c":1,"w":0.34809038798014325,"t":"While it is undeniable that AI has opened up"},{"y":0.44040697681649321,"x":0.086505193624852789,"c":1,"w":0.33564013163248696,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"a wealth of promising opportunities, it has"},{"t":"also led to the emergence of a mindset that","c":1,"h":0.019533687241849895,"x":0.08638649529062406,"y":0.45693442552918362,"w":0.33762524922688797},{"t":"can be best described as 'AI solutionism'.","y":0.47515745243454943,"h":0.017575105142559999,"c":1,"w":0.32698961893717449,"x":0.086505193455288162},{"x":0.088092906308167324,"w":0.32382403055826825,"y":0.49194526210720269,"t":"This is the philosophy that, given enough","h":0.022806313089593688,"c":1},{"t":"data, machine learning algorithms can","x":0.088069879449034355,"y":0.51176639583223205,"w":0.30133880615234376,"h":0.020577021626178249,"c":1},{"w":0.31833910624186201,"y":0.5304408674487916,"c":1,"t":"solve all of humanity's problems. But, in","x":0.086505187371937589,"h":0.018977737159809105},{"t":"fact, instead of supporting Al progress,","x":0.086505187017505564,"h":0.018978753567075568,"y":0.54933519965406408,"c":1,"w":0.31141868591308597},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"t":"this mindset actually jeopardises the value","y":0.56822953102679086,"w":0.33044982910156251,"x":0.086505189179119008},{"t":"of machine intelligence by disregarding","w":0.3082471211751302,"c":1,"y":0.58498295305069248,"x":0.088119805675974827,"h":0.019521416943752312},{"w":0.33044982910156251,"h":0.01891569160263884,"t":"important AI safety principles and setting","c":1,"x":0.086505192694028399,"y":0.60319767421345327},{"w":0.33391003926595053,"x":0.088235291703912436,"y":0.62351294623488918,"t":"unrealistic expectations about what AI can","h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1},{"y":0.64098837226300687,"w":0.179930788675944,"h":0.017514077327399957,"c":1,"t":"really do for humanity.","x":0.088235299260643912},{"t":"In only a few years, AI solutionism has made","y":0.67639991250332676,"c":1,"x":0.088109693939862926,"w":0.35319089253743485,"h":0.020594313229773786},{"y":0.69319721352212738,"w":0.31529032389322914,"t":"its way from the technology evangelists'","x":0.086346105576241658,"h":0.023037311828912332,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.71081523478775743,"t":"mouths in Silicon Valley in California to","x":0.088015470885551436,"h":0.022420302565236305,"w":0.31701418558756511},{"y":0.73202215027706863,"t":"the minds of government officials and","w":0.29783465067545573,"h":0.01876381779985048,"c":1,"x":0.088122293558670087},{"y":0.74984353420124683,"t":"policymakers around the world. The","x":0.088099346795889155,"h":0.019114476304691541,"w":0.28741854349772133,"c":1},{"x":0.088235297126189535,"c":1,"w":0.32006919860839844,"h":0.01744186102384615,"y":0.76889534853219466,"t":"pendulum has swung from the dystopian"},{"x":0.088113415299505865,"y":0.78639791277118154,"t":"notion that AI will destroy humanity to the","w":0.33936396280924475,"c":1,"h":0.020062772271681517},{"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"y":0.80668604658347809,"t":"utopian belief that our algorithmic saviour","w":0.33564013163248696,"x":0.088235297433364418},{"w":0.05941528956095378,"c":1,"t":"is here.","y":0.8255931056545367,"x":0.086301296269231428,"h":0.014172754895028117},{"c":1,"h":0.016115514276076048,"y":0.8617914623856342,"t":"We are now seeing governments pledge","w":0.30449826558430992,"x":0.0899653999880375},{"x":0.088009224362321989,"t":"support to national Al initiatives and","w":0.29286702473958331,"h":0.019761939078798862,"y":0.87751689763088614,"c":1},{"h":0.020292525027830965,"x":0.088046947287159297,"y":0.89587677841409608,"t":"compete in a technological race to","w":0.26851440429687501,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.33910034179687504,"h":0.017494751574527623,"x":0.088235299776302914,"t":"dominate the burgeoning machine-learning","y":0.91567529761180089},{"h":0.017494751574527623,"y":0.93456962891856354,"c":1,"t":"sector. While many politicians proclaim","x":0.088235293651172012,"w":0.31141868591308597},{"c":1,"x":0.089965398278399389,"w":0.022491348584493004,"y":0.96220930239523783,"t":"46","h":0.013081395100512871},{"h":0.020522875081750325,"t":"the transformative effects of the coming","y":0.2353957131669393,"x":0.45656214946171775,"w":0.31526977539062501,"c":1},{"t":"'AI revolution', they fail to realise the","h":0.018936034430149462,"c":1,"w":0.29065745035807294,"x":0.45847750315487362,"y":0.2557732678549437},{"y":0.27466759997214363,"c":1,"x":0.45674740575933659,"w":0.30795847574869795,"h":0.017494751574527623,"t":"complexity around deploying advanced"},{"t":"machine learning systems in the real world.","w":0.34083045959472658,"h":0.016095171448565315,"c":1,"x":0.45674739988191748,"y":0.29356193143147324},{"x":0.45837081320392875,"y":0.32806044619923558,"h":0.020517664242658329,"c":1,"t":"One of the most promising varieties of AI","w":0.32895123799641929},{"w":0.34274182637532552,"t":"technologies are neural networks. This form","y":0.34706836293838239,"h":0.018187318672409747,"c":1,"x":0.45665720782931601},{"w":0.3358331298828125,"x":0.45666680767650641,"t":"of machine learning is loosely modelled on","y":0.36438039680844092,"c":1,"h":0.019032645842843809},{"w":0.33788589477539066,"t":"the neuronal structure of the human brain,","x":0.45655590865040607,"h":0.023276222928409585,"y":0.37945441427701676,"c":1},{"x":0.45839551070766504,"h":0.016959809022320083,"c":1,"t":"but on a much smaller scale. But what many","w":0.3427299499511719,"y":0.4016983502903384},{"w":0.33755289713541664,"t":"politicians do not understand is that simply","x":0.45837728947070028,"h":0.018887497813156129,"c":1,"y":0.4201044010886561},{"y":0.43887005227960385,"w":0.33062566121419268,"c":1,"h":0.018686235159572906,"x":0.45666815919810444,"t":"adding a neural network to a problem will"},{"c":1,"x":0.45674740757857024,"w":0.32006919860839844,"t":"not automatically mean that you'Il find a","y":0.45784883727950154,"h":0.015988371937820656},{"y":0.47483984375129307,"t":"solution. Similarly, adding a neural network","w":0.34623758951822919,"c":1,"x":0.4566407188310862,"h":0.020218047668585148},{"c":1,"y":0.49405178436507913,"w":0.34775085449218751,"h":0.017576122884570111,"t":"to a system of government does not mean it","x":0.45674741007224534},{"c":1,"h":0.017523231666516925,"t":"will be instantaneously more inclusive or fair.","x":0.4584775057298392,"y":0.5115465360418836,"w":0.35294118245442702},{"x":0.45847751715091267,"c":1,"y":0.54793561962190107,"h":0.018924845274383983,"t":"AI systems need a lot of data to function,","w":0.32871971130371092},{"t":"but the public sector typically does not","w":0.30472338358561202,"h":0.019279602776881677,"x":0.45837570569946329,"y":0.56644383578894864,"c":1},{"y":0.58425723576326516,"w":0.33417434692382808,"h":0.019704864106869002,"c":1,"t":"have the appropriate data infrastructure to","x":0.45833164667535908},{"c":1,"x":0.456747402451741,"w":0.33391003926595059,"t":"support advanced machine learning. Most","y":0.60461861447231824,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"t":"of the data remains stored in offline archives.","w":0.35121106465657553,"c":1,"y":0.62063953480143863,"h":0.015988371937820545,"x":0.45847751329454961},{"c":1,"x":0.4584005675689648,"t":"The few digitised sources of data that exist","y":0.63942201710176272,"w":0.33752621968587243,"h":0.019435994686823443},{"h":0.018966548671415451,"y":0.65843023258179911,"x":0.45847751260102126,"c":1,"w":0.35121106465657553,"t":"tend to be buried in bureaucracy. More often"},{"w":0.31013829549153649,"y":0.67480003334156957,"h":0.022358477240763341,"c":1,"t":"than not, data is spread across different","x":0.45826473709994653},{"w":0.33441408793131511,"c":1,"t":"government departments that each require","x":0.45819178088271484,"y":0.6929824078450233,"h":0.023371795910567705},{"t":"special permissions to be accessed. Above","x":0.45832992720255455,"w":0.32724985758463548,"c":1,"y":0.71260053915462851,"h":0.018980329231918946},{"t":"all, the public sector typically lacks the","y":0.73255813924966573,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1,"x":0.45847751072866438,"w":0.30449826558430992},{"w":0.32698961893717454,"x":0.45847751148296972,"y":0.74842547224694056,"h":0.019016387998181838,"c":1,"t":"human talent with the right technological"},{"w":0.30449826558430992,"t":"capabilities to fully reap the benefits of","x":0.45847751073167575,"y":0.76889534855221797,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.16435985565185551,"t":"machine intelligence.","y":0.78779069773570531,"h":0.015988371937820545,"x":0.45847751151981053},{"h":0.016113480126799362,"y":0.82400279886010741,"x":0.45847751009771209,"w":0.28892733256022141,"c":1,"t":"For these reasons, the sensationalism"},{"c":1,"t":"over Al has attracted many critics. Stuart","x":0.45835588774139147,"y":0.84086319360482809,"h":0.019745479687850231,"w":0.32549672444661459},{"x":0.45847751260211178,"y":0.86039188261602784,"c":1,"w":0.31660898844401042,"t":"Russell, a professor of computer science","h":0.017515094402038245},{"w":0.32226626078287757,"h":0.022833457770591203,"c":1,"t":"at the University of California, Berkeley,","x":0.45829822777681328,"y":0.8750449701678007},{"h":0.018240941997338611,"w":0.3099111684163412,"x":0.45837861165958088,"c":1,"y":0.89640790116889169,"t":"has long advocated a more sensible and"},{"c":1,"w":0.31860109965006506,"h":0.019399333283816045,"t":"realistic approach that focuses on simple","x":0.45834327288765481,"y":0.91438862260794085},{"w":0.33257158915201823,"h":0.021322291743263055,"t":"everyday applications of AI instead of the","x":0.45824416803645707,"c":1,"y":0.930589556001442}]}